msgstr "%s fechadas"

#: includes/admin-log.php:584
msgid ""
"What happened on this site, newest first. It shows only what was being "
"recorded at the time: a group ticked this morning has nothing in it from "
"yesterday."
msgstr ""
"O que aconteceu neste site, do mais novo para o mais antigo. Mostra só o que "
"estava sendo registrado na hora: um grupo marcado hoje de manhã não tem nada "
"de ontem."

#: includes/admin-log.php:613 includes/admin-log.php:696
#: includes/log-privacy.php:80
