#: includes/admin-log.php:209
msgid ""
"Every row of this site goes, whatever its age, and this tab starts again "
"from nothing. What is recorded from then on follows the network’s log "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Todas as linhas deste site vão embora, seja qual for a idade, e esta aba "
"recomeça do zero. O que for registrado a partir daí segue as configurações "
"do registro da rede."

#: includes/admin-log.php:322
msgid "Nothing is being recorded on any site of the network."
msgstr "Nada está sendo registrado em nenhum site da rede."

#: includes/admin-log.php:786
msgid "Network Admin › Activity log"
msgstr "Administração da rede › Registro de atividade"

#: includes/admin-login.php:718
msgid ""
"On this network these are switched on or off for every site at once, in "
"Network Admin: social accounts under Social login › Rules, passkeys under "
"Security › Passkeys."
msgstr ""
"Nesta rede eles são ativados ou desativados para todos os sites de uma vez, "
"na Administração da rede: as contas sociais em Login social › Regras, as "
"passkeys em Segurança › Passkeys."

#: includes/admin-network.php:278
msgid "The network"
msgstr "A rede"

#: includes/admin-network.php:289
msgid "Deleting the plugin"
msgstr "Excluir o plugin"

#: includes/admin-network.php:316
msgid ""
"On this network the plugin applies one set of rules to every site. Who gets "
"in and how safely, the social sign-in apps, the fields a person has and what "
"the activity log keeps are decided here, for all of them. Each site keeps "
"its own menus, admin bar, reports and maintenance."
msgstr ""
"Nesta rede o plugin aplica um único conjunto de regras a todos os sites. "
"Quem entra e com quanta segurança, os apps de login social, os campos que "
"uma pessoa tem e o que o registro de atividade guarda são decididos aqui, "
"para todos eles. Cada site mantém os próprios menus, barra de administração, "
"relatórios e manutenção."

#: includes/admin-network.php:333
msgid "Where the accounts live"
msgstr "Onde as contas ficam"

#: includes/admin-network.php:335
msgid ""
"The main site of the network. Its sign-in, registration and account pages, "
"and how they look, are set on its own dashboard."
msgstr ""
"O site principal da rede. As páginas de acesso, cadastro e conta dele, e a "
"aparência delas, são configuradas no próprio painel."

#: includes/admin-network.php:339
msgid "Open its dashboard"
